== arc criteria manifest ==
phase_half                | phase                       | i -> j iff j is clockwise from i by less than 1/2
origin_clearance_rank     | endpoint                    | farther from stationary observer points to closer
endpoint_deficit_rank     | endpoint                    | smaller deficit below 1/N points to larger deficit
two_neighbor_guard        | two-neighbor                | larger sum of two nearest circular distances points to smaller
dyadic_height             | x*2 branch                  | higher v2(speed) branch points to lower branch
odd_core_row              | x+2 row                     | smaller odd core points to larger odd core
same_chain_dyadic_phase   | x*2 over phase              | same odd-core chain uses dyadic branch; other pairs use phase
adjacent_oddrow_phase     | x+2 over phase              | adjacent odd rows differ by 2; otherwise use phase
product_sum_gate          | addition*multiplication     | near (a-1)(b-1)=N-1 product-sum pairs override phase
goldbach_lemoine_gate     | prime additive gate         | even N uses p+q; odd N uses p+2q; otherwise phase
danger_then_grid          | LRC threshold + operation grid | pairs closer than 1/N use endpoint danger then grid order
operation_bundle_vote     | bundle                      | phase, endpoint, two-neighbor, dyadic, odd, product-sum, and prime gates vote

