== interpretation ==
A000568 is the unmarked quotient of complete binary relations.  Its Burnside formula only sees odd permutation cycles; the LRC operation-grid lift keeps a parallel odd/even memory by splitting each speed into an odd x+2 row and a vertical x*2 branch.
Addition supplies fixed-sum and adjacent-row gates: Goldbach p+q=N for even N and Lemoine p+2q=N for odd N.  Multiplication supplies branch/factor gates: dyadic height, odd cores, divisibility, and the shifted product-sum equation (a-1)(b-1)=N-1.
The useful loneliness object is therefore not a scalar H.  It is a marked fiber over A000568 carrying phase H, observer score, close-pair tie rate, two-neighbor width, strict pressure SCCs, and operation-grid labels.
